      <h2>Migration checklist</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Export consent evidence and suppression history; validate present permission and purchaser exclusions</li>
        <li>Rebuild abandoned cart with an eligible holdout cohort and event-parity checks</li>
        <li>Document collision rules with welcome/SMS, queue ownership and replay deduplication</li>
        <li>Inventory-aware suppressions before discounts</li>
        <li>Margin review at day 30 post-cutover</li>
      </ul>
